# CEA (lambda = 1) with CRVAL2 = 15 and LONPOLE = 90: phi_p - phi_0 = 90
# with theta_0 = 0 makes the native-pole latitude depend on LATPOLE alone
# (wcslib cel.c "latpreq = 2" branch). LATPOLE = 40. Synthetic.
NOTE pipeline: LONPOLE = 90 on CEA, pole latitude from LATPOLE only
